# Replace the Stage 4 logic

Current logic is conceptually:

```python
delta = child_eval.objective_scores[objective] - parent_eval.objective_scores[objective]
scheduler.update_scope_credit(delta)
archive.insert(child)
predictors.add_observation(child_eval)
```

Replace it with:

```python
signal = self.progress_oracle.compare_parent_child(
    parent_dir=parent_dir,
    child_dir=child_dir,
    objective=objective,
    scope=scope,
    base_validation=stage4.validation_result,
)

if signal.decision == "capability_promote":
    self.capability_archive.insert(child_dir, signal)
    self.scheduler.update_scope_credit(
        objective.name,
        scope,
        signal.quality_delta_lower / max(1, len(scope)),
    )
    self.capability_predictors.add_observation(signal)

elif signal.decision == "efficiency_promote":
    self.efficiency_archive.insert(child_dir, signal)
    self.efficiency_predictors.add_observation(signal)

elif signal.decision == "preference_promote":
    self.preference_archive.insert(child_dir, signal)

elif signal.decision in {"reject", "abstain", "no_progress"}:
    self.progress_log.append(signal)

elif signal.decision == "quarantine":
    self.quarantine_log.append(signal)
```

No raw scalar objective score is allowed to update the capability archive.

