# The hard truth: current exact tasks are not enough

If the suite consists of tasks where:

```text
output is either exactly right or wrong
and most candidates already get it right
and no hidden variants are generated
and no pairwise artifact comparator exists
```

then there is no capability signal left.

That is not a validation problem. That is a benchmark design problem.

So the real engineering requirement is:

```text
Every promotable objective must have at least one unsaturated quality axis.
```

If an objective has no unsaturated axis, the system must emit:

```json
{
  "decision": "no_capability_signal",
  "reason": "all quality axes saturated; only efficiency comparison available",
  "required_action": "generate frontier challenges or add pairwise quality comparator"
}
```

Do not let it silently optimize cost.

