# The concrete patch to the previous design

The previous design should be modified like this:

```text
Validation Kernel:
    Trust filter.
    Produces admissible evidence.

Progress Oracle:
    Better-than comparator.
    Produces quality delta.

Optimizer:
    Consumes only ProgressSignal.
    Capability state updates require quality improvement.
    Efficiency state updates require quality equivalence + cost improvement.
```

So the final architecture becomes:

```text
Search proposes child
    ↓
Runner executes parent and child on same hidden/generated tasks
    ↓
Validation Kernel checks safety/provenance/hard gates
    ↓
Progress Oracle runs paired quality comparison
    ↓
Promotion Engine emits CapabilitySignal or EfficiencySignal
    ↓
Optimizer updates only the matching archive/prior
```

The crucial invariant is:

```text
No capability update from cost-only delta.
```

